 5 Strength

Weight: 5"


	SAY NAME2 "Ixil's Nail +6"
	SAY DESC "With shaft and tip reunited, Ixil's Spike is a fearsome weapon. During the battle, the head can detach to pin opponents to the ground even as a new head magically reforms on the end of the spear.

